            },
            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "Ah well of course, it was documented:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/echasnovski/mini.operators/blob/81e5059268154f5a8b594c95748968febdd539e3/doc/mini-operators.txt#L362-L365\r\n\r\n> - Advantages of using this instead of \"visually select\" + \"paste with |v_P|\":\r\n>   - As operator it is dot-repeatable which has cumulative gain in case of\r\n>     multiple replacing is needed.\r\n>   - Can automatically reindent.\r\n\r\nThe automatic reindent is a very noticeable difference, which makes it worth to have.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Ah well of course, it was documented:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.operators/blob/81e5059268154f5a8b594c95748968febdd539e3/doc/mini-operators.txt#L362-L365\">https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.operators/blob/81e5059268154f5a8b594c95748968febdd539e3/doc/mini-operators.txt#L362-L365</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Advantages of using this instead of \"visually select\" + \"paste with |v_P|\":\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>As operator it is dot-repeatable which has cumulative gain in case of<br>\nmultiple replacing is needed.</li>\n<li>Can automatically reindent.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The automatic reindent is a very noticeable difference, which makes it worth to have.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Ah well of course, it was documented:\nhttps://github.com/echasnovski/mini.operators/blob/81e5059268154f5a8b594c95748968febdd539e3/doc/mini-operators.txt#L362-L365\n\n\nAdvantages of using this instead of \"visually select\" + \"paste with |v_P|\":\n\nAs operator it is dot-repeatable which has cumulative gain in case of\nmultiple replacing is needed.\nCan automatically reindent.\n\n\n\n\nThe automatic reindent is a very noticeable difference, which makes it worth to have.",
